      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, that's a pretty strong distinction. You mentioned Dr. Adeyemi's work might be seen as \"less rigorous\" because of the focus on traditional practices. Do you think the methodology itself is the issue, or is it more about how the subject matter is perceived in the broader scientific community? Elaborate on why you'd say his name lacks \"academic gravitas\" compared to Sterling's.",
