      "content": "That's a really interesting take. So you're saying that the perceived \"rigor\" or \"establishment\" of a researcher's work is actually tied to how much their topic and even their personal identity align with Western standards? If we were looking at a journal that prioritized global ecological impact over Western-centric models, would that change your assessment of their authority?",
